      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FAKE FRIENDS (9) has changed yards since tackling last Saturday's Breeders Challenge Blue 3F Final in Sydney. Runner-up in a heat of that series prior and also won a heat of the main Breeders Challenge series at Menangle last month. That is strong form for this despite the second line draw. LAINE CRUSADER (4) led from this barrier and kept giving to salute last start over 1980m at this venue. Stepping up a level this time but is still lightly raced with upside. BEEJAYS BLING (3) has ground to make up on LAINE CRUSADER through the last-start second but draws well again. MAXI ANGEL (7) cannot be left out after solid recent performances, the latest a sound second at this venue.",
